		{"id":"9a224206ac4b1cb7","type":"text","text":"The Crucible is a brawling arena in the Braving Grounds District of Vasselheim. It fits the theme of the Braving Grounds, which are dedicated to Normingander, a god of battle and competition, though the Crucible is a regular fighting pit and there is a separate, sacred arena for very special occasions.\n","x":-125,"y":-30,"width":685,"height":310},
